    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098140/extras/d765171bd0a198d770de9103e9d2cde6.avif?t=1733541567\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098140/extras/0627ab3e179f156bf49485a4ba306164.avif?t=1733541567\" /></div><br><br><strong>Reflect and draw! Drawing Path is a game that aims to make you reflect in order to solve levels where you have to collect all the balls in the cup.</strong><br><br>The goal remains simple on the surface, but the more you progress through the levels, the harder your brain will be challenged!<br>Two modes are available: 50 levels with drawings under gravity and 50 levels without gravity.<br><br><strong><i>Will you be able to complete all levels?</i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1098140/extras/c092928b082fb2e62a793cc3f6a534eb.webp?t=1733541567\" /></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>\u25a0 100 different levels!<br>\u25a0 2 different game modes!<br>\u25a0 Variable difficulty !<br>\u25a0 Addictive gameplay!<br>\u25a0 Good music!",
